<https://w3id.org/ontojourney/core#JourneyModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Description that characterises a reusable journey pattern through one or more Stage Specifications and one Closure Specification, and may prescribe Intended Transformations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontojourney/core#AssistanceProvision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An event within an HLJ Stage Execution in which assistance specified for that stage is provided."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontojourney/core#ConditionDescription> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/ontojourney/core#MissionSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Normative Description that states what the Learner is invited or expected to pursue within an HLJ stage and may combine a desired result with directions for action."@en .
