<https://w3id.org/ontojourney/core#PlanDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Normative Description that prescribes or organises intended actions and events towards a purpose."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontojourney/core#HeroicNarrativeJourneyExecution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Narrative Journey Execution of a Heroic Narrative Journey Model that constitutes one focal heroic trajectory with exactly one Protagonist."@en .
