<https://w3id.org/ontojourney/core#ClosureSituation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A situation brought about by a Journey Execution that satisfies a Closure Specification; in a successful execution, that specification is defined by the executed model."@en .
